---
/* FAQ — a switchboard, not an accordion list. One answer panel, wiped on change. */
---
<section class="faq g-paper" id="faq" data-fade>
  <div class="faq__head">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="margin:0">Questions</p>
    <p class="faq__note">Everything people actually ask</p>
  </div>
  <!-- THE MECHANIC — seed 7JAE2yr4Q7C5p6LUoNEaFjpw, read structurally:
       digits interrupt letters at irregular intervals, no repeating rhythm.
       So: every answer IS printed, but COVERED by a solid bar of irregular
       width. Uncovering wipes the bar off to the left; the text was always
       there. Nothing expands, nothing collapses — the row height never
       changes, so the list cannot jump under your thumb.

       Why this and not an accordion: "No Bushels" is a lamp that is not
       hidden under a bowl. Occlusion is a LIGHT behaviour, so this is
       physics, not iconography (B6a) — and the section performs the theme
       instead of illustrating it. One open at a time. -->
  <div class="faq__board" data-placeholder="P9">
    <div class="faq__index" role="tablist" aria-label="Questions">
        <button class="faq__item" type="button" data-i="0" data-on="1"
                aria-selected="true" role="tab" aria-controls="fp0">
          <span class="faq__n">01</span>
          <span class="faq__qt">Is it really free?</span>
        </button>
        <button class="faq__item" type="button" data-i="1" data-on="0"
                aria-selected="false" role="tab" aria-controls="fp1">
          <span class="faq__n">02</span>
          <span class="faq__qt">Do I have to be a Christian?</span>
        </button>
        <button class="faq__item" type="button" data-i="2" data-on="0"
                aria-selected="false" role="tab" aria-controls="fp2">
          <span class="faq__n">03</span>
          <span class="faq__qt">Can I come alone?</span>
        </button>
        <button class="faq__item" type="button" data-i="3" data-on="0"
                aria-selected="false" role="tab" aria-controls="fp3">
          <span class="faq__n">04</span>
          <span class="faq__qt">Am I good enough?</span>
        </button>
        <button class="faq__item" type="button" data-i="4" data-on="0"
                aria-selected="false" role="tab" aria-controls="fp4">
          <span class="faq__n">05</span>
          <span class="faq__qt">What should I bring?</span>
        </button>
        <button class="faq__item" type="button" data-i="5" data-on="0"
                aria-selected="false" role="tab" aria-controls="fp5">
          <span class="faq__n">06</span>
          <span class="faq__qt">Where exactly is it?</span>
        </button>
    </div>
    <div class="faq__display">
        <p class="faq__answer" id="fp0" data-i="0" data-on="1" role="tabpanel">Yes. No ticket, no fee, no catch. Register so we know how many chairs to put out.</p>
        <p class="faq__answer" id="fp1" data-i="1" data-on="0" role="tabpanel">No. No Bushels is cross-denominational and creatives-first. If you make things, you belong in the room.</p>
        <p class="faq__answer" id="fp2" data-i="2" data-on="0" role="tabpanel">Most people do. That's rather the point of it.</p>
        <p class="faq__answer" id="fp3" data-i="3" data-on="0" role="tabpanel">There's no bar. Bring whatever you're working on, however finished it is.</p>
        <p class="faq__answer" id="fp4" data-i="4" data-on="0" role="tabpanel">Yourself, and the thing you're making. Instruments, laptops and hard drives all welcome.</p>
        <p class="faq__answer" id="fp5" data-i="5" data-on="0" role="tabpanel">EU Centre, Warri · 21 November 2026. Full directions go out with your confirmation.</p>
      <span class="faq__wipe" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
